This is a curated, self-contained copy of ppt-master's template-import + SVG->DrawingML
modules so ppt-agent reuses user .pptx templates with NO external dependency on a sibling
ppt-master checkout. Entry points used by ppt-agent:
  - pptx_template_import.py   (template package: manifest + layout SVG skeletons + assets)
  - svg_to_pptx.py            (per-page SVG -> native editable DrawingML)
Do not edit ad hoc; re-vendor from upstream ppt-master to update.
